0kNvHhVefn_TBrgNcwEldocVz2qn-gNfnCKsPILtJlozJnINN3ONP_oQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM8xU7hHl7FZPdEi-XD9s1oXkAOqh-YkHWJdGDsXv4ALw&oe=6AC674FF"}, {"file_name": "FINALES_05.png", "id": "2562862047473135", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830822_2562862050806468_3981593933838214279_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C0BxM-o_YUEQ7kNvwE80tx4&_nc_oc=Adp8G4-w9c5l92T5w1ZqaJejAMbiy6tupsPMzEF9lYVqCazzi-mfPaz_PcICLnspYJ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMdizx7qAfx77EVKoUUlJ7YTm91rlRaVB_WseJjhO5w1w&oe=6AC66D5B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Marenostrum.VR", "keywords": ["education", "mediterranean", "marinelife", "ocean", "underwater"], "long_description": "Marenostrum.VR is a free educational virtual reality experience that invites you to explore the Mediterranean seabed and discover its marine biodiversity.\n\nMove freely through an immersive underwater environment populated by different species of fish, marine animals and Mediterranean vegetation. Observe the ecosystem at your own pace and experience the scale, movement and diversity of marine life from a new perspective.\n\nDesigned as an educational and contemplative experience, Marenostrum.VR focuses on exploration and observation rather than complex gameplay or interactions.\n\nDeveloped by X-Trudio LAB 3D at ERAM University School of the Arts as part of an educational project.\n\nCompatible with Meta Quest 2, Quest Pro, Quest 3 family and future supported devices.", "short_description": "Explore the Mediterranean seabed in an immersive educational VR experience. Discover its marine life and observe iconic species in their natural environment.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.eram.cat/wp-content/uploads/politica-provacitat-marenostrum-ca.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.eram.cat/ca/escola-universita